[3.674787, "o", "\u001b[1mAdumbra\u001b[0m — Confidential Order Routing for FXRP on Flare\r\n\u001b[90mRoute in shadow. Settle on chain.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90mFlare Summer Signal · Bounty 2: Confidential Compute Apps\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[5.203747, "o", "\u001b[36m\u001b[1m[1/6] Live and source-verified on Flare Coston2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.89901, "o", "\u001b[90m  AdumbraRouter  0xcA1BFA56281a5082EfcAa64bbd34653b0AfCCAc7\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.48667, "o", "  order nonce: \u001b[1m4\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.148421, "o", "  trader FXRP  999,600.00\r\n"]
[7.186567, "o", "  trader USDC  999,606.96\r\n"]
[8.394014, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m[2/6] Starting the enclave\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.103174, "o", "\u001b[90m  In production this binary runs inside SGX / AWS Nitro.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.508192, "o", "\u001b[90m  It holds the signing key and never reveals its routing logic.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.938878, "o", "\u001b[32m  enclave listening on :7070\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.443233, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m[3/6] The trader submits an intent — 100 FXRP for USDC\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.153016, "o", "\u001b[90m  They declare WHAT they want. Never HOW to route it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.567191, "o", "\u001b[90m  POST localhost:7070/sign\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.449429, "o", "  {\r\n      \"user\": \"0x612eb784bF5C8BE0D20e2486Aee161Fb1fE8F07A\",\r\n      \"token_in\": \"0x92bdD788e158Db8d7b0F2Dc32ddefe0fC8783fC5\",\r\n      \"token_out\": \"0x1cAAb501Cb8D7959e5Def5577863a4b346523552\",\r\n      \"amount_in\": \"100000000000000000000\",\r\n      \"min_amount_out\": \"51740000000000000000\",\r\n      \"deadline\": 1785867132,\r\n      \"order_nonce\": \"4\",\r\n      \"signature\": \"0xe7a1e50026ce...0403cb62c51b\",\r\n      \"tee_report\": \"Enclave 0x423ece2094 routed FXRP -> USDC at rate 0.520000\"\r\n  }\r\n"]
[16.46244, "o", "\r\n\u001b[90m  What is absent from that response is the point: no path, no pools,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.863754, "o", "\u001b[90m  no quote derivation, no slippage strategy. That never left the enclave.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.07791, "o", "\r\n"]
[19.16702, "o", "\u001b[36m\u001b[1m[4/6] The contract re-derives the digest and runs ecrecover\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.877127, "o", "\u001b[90m  A different key, one altered field, a stale deadline, a reused nonce → revert.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[21.141523, "o", "\u001b[32m  signature accepted — static call returns 51.74 USDC out\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.149012, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m[5/6] Settling on Flare\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.928715, "o", "  blockNumber          33625908\r\n  gasUsed              82568\r\n  status               1 (success)\r\n  transactionHash      0xf9dce6b10a09e8e0e77d4a20c1bdc1eaddd2b114bce24d1ad6ca2e288a9a56e3\r\n"]
[27.435559, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m[6/6] Settled\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.785927, "o", "  FXRP  999,600.00  →  999,500.00\r\n"]
[28.863364, "o", "  USDC  999,606.96  →  999,658.70\r\n  order nonce  4 → 5   \u001b[90mthis order can never replay\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.667476, "o", "\r\n\u001b[32mBy the time a searcher can read this transaction, it is already settled.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[31.168778, "o", "\u001b[90mThere is no ordering advantage left to extract.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[31.58502, "o", "\r\n\u001b[33mgithub.com/Carlys17/adumbra-flare\u001b[0m\r\n"]
